    "body": "We have not yet implemented (or identified) low latency paths for all platforms. On Windows, we'd likely use the DirectX hardware overlay feature [1], and do the rasterization on the CPU.\r\n\r\n[1] [DirectX overlays](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/windows/desktop/dd797814(v=vs.85).aspx)",
