    "updated_at": "2017-05-10T19:57:51Z",
    "body": "I don't know this part of the code well, but AFAICT, in the chromium code base we currently only have implementations for low-latency rendering buffers on two platforms:  On MacOS we use IOSurfaces, and on ChromeOS there is something called a native pixmap.\r\n",
